dade de Prateleiras: 05 Prateleiras', 830.8, 830.8, NULL, 'Home & Living > Furniture > Desks & Tables', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825a9-mqqj7b61beo008', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F855489892%2F22597729732', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
