podem variar de acordo com o lote do fabricante.', 62.9, 62.9, NULL, 'Mom & Baby > Feeding Essentials > Bottle-feeding', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7qvfv-lid5obxzfozt2a', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F340054154%2F23496100580', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (source, external_id, title, description, price, sale_price, discount_pct, category, image_url, affiliate_link, shop_name, rating, updated_at) VALUES ('shopee', '23499368602', 'Vinil Rolling Stones - Black and Blue (2LP/Colour) - Importado', 'Vinil Rolling Stones - Black and Blue (2LP/Colour) - Importado 2 LPs em vinil marmorizado Black and Blue, com uma nova mixagem de Steven Wilson, além de outtakes e jams inéditos, incluindo a batida disco de alta energia de "Shame, Shame, Shame", de Shirley and Company, e jams com guitarristas convidados, incluindo Jeff Beck, Harvey Mandel, do Canned Heat, e Robert A. Johnson. Black and Blue, de 1976, é o álbum que introduziu Ronnie Wood aos Rolling Stones – com participação em três faixas e acompanhando a banda na turnê mundial e nos 50 anos seguintes! Tracklist: Disco 1: Steven Wilson Remix 2025 Lado A 1. Hot Stuff 2. Hand Of Fate 3. Cherry Oh Baby 4. Memory Motel Lado B 5. Hey Negrita (Inspiration by Ron Wood) 6. Melody (Inspiration by Billy Preston) 7. Fool To Cry 8. Crazy Mama Disco 2: Outtakes and Jams Lado A 1. I Love Ladies 2. Shame, Shame, Shame 3. Chuck Berry Style Jam (With Harvey Mandel) Lado B 4. Blues Jam (With Jeff Beck) 5. Rotterdam Jam (With Jeff Beck and Robert A. Johnson) 6. Freeway Jam (With Jeff Beck)', 399.9, 319.9, NULL, 'Hobbies & Collections > Vinyl Records', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825aw-mr0jrvco0qvb9a', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1356917260%2F23499368602', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
